Data notice

The MIT licence above covers the source code in this repository (src/, scripts/, env/ except the
files named below).

The derived tables and results produced by the authors - data/frozen, data/derived, tables/,
results/, figures/, provenance/data, provenance/changelogs and the annotation files - are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Third-party data keep their own licences and terms and are NOT relicensed by this repository:
  * the recommendation list of Lee et al. (2021), Zenodo version 2, 10.5281/zenodo.5146276 (CC BY 4.0),
    and its parsed copy in data/raw/lee_recommendations_parsed.csv;
  * the species list of Table A2 of Lee et al. (2021) (data/raw/table_a2_anchors.csv), reproduced
    as factual data with citation;
  * umda (MIT, Copyright 2020 Kin Long Kelvin Lee), fetched at a pinned commit and not included;
  * env/mol2vec_features_patched.py, derived from mol2vec (BSD 3-Clause, env/LICENSE-mol2vec.txt);
  * the candidate-pool sources (QM9, ZINC, PubChem, PCBA, KIDA, NASA Ames PAHdb), which are
    downloaded by the scripts and not redistributed; see README.md for their terms;
  * NASA ADS records, of which only identifiers and titles are included.
